          "explanation": "The twin-care context was visible from the start.",
          "quote": "双胞胎里小的那个"
        }
      ],
      "completion": "not_completed",
      "explanation": "HO3 was triggered by the twin household context, but the doctor did not create a twin-specific anti-confusion system such as separate baby labels, separate symptom/urine/feeding records, fixed medication reader, or color coding for each twin.",
      "ho_id": "HO3",
      "meaningful_trajectory_impact": false,
      "triggered": true
    },
    {
      "active_model_action": false,
      "citations": [
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00042",
          "explanation": "The caregiver presented a medication handoff conflict that needed repair.",
          "quote": "维生素AD滴剂写每日1粒，维生素D滴剂也写每日1粒"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00066",
          "explanation": "The doctor did not repair the discrepancy; instead, the doctor made an unverified interim medication decision.",
          "quote": "今天先只喂“维生素AD滴剂”每日1粒"
        }
      ],
      "completion": "not_completed",
      "explanation": "HO4 was triggered by the conflict between the discharge labels and family uncertainty. The doctor advised later verification, but the creditable repair was not completed because the doctor overrode the stated discharge labels before confirming the responsible service’s intent.",
      "ho_id": "HO4",
      "meaningful_trajectory_impact": false,
      "triggered": true
    }
  ],
  "important_non_chain_defect_assessment": {
    "category": "none",
